// 正确结果：最后一根柱附近 5 个并排矩形，蓝色背景透明度从 0% 到 80% 依次递增
indicator("Chart Test: graph/box/bg_color", overlay: true, max_boxes_count: 10);

if bar_state.is_last {
    let top = close * 1.02;
    let bot = close * 0.98;
    Box.new(bar_index - 22, top, bar_index - 20, bot, bg_color: Color.new(Color.BLUE, 0),  border_color: Color.BLUE);
    Box.new(bar_index - 17, top, bar_index - 15, bot, bg_color: Color.new(Color.BLUE, 20), border_color: Color.BLUE);
    Box.new(bar_index - 12, top, bar_index - 10, bot, bg_color: Color.new(Color.BLUE, 40), border_color: Color.BLUE);
    Box.new(bar_index - 7,  top, bar_index - 5,  bot, bg_color: Color.new(Color.BLUE, 60), border_color: Color.BLUE);
    Box.new(bar_index - 2,  top, bar_index,      bot, bg_color: Color.new(Color.BLUE, 80), border_color: Color.BLUE);
}
